      "type": "other",
      "description": "Visual digits (1-9) presented successively in randomized order in the middle of the screen (112 pt Chicago font) for 700 ms each, with ISIs of 800-1000 ms. A warning stimulus (three decreasing rectangles) preceded digit presentation.",
